 &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 22:51:27 +08:00\">13h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我就是菲区退了重开现在不怎么降智。和之前的区别是弄了个干净的住宅 IP ，然后登录的设备和并发量减少了。<br>如果刚需顶级模型的话还是可以开，除非能开到 claude 并且不封号，不然 gpt 是唯一选择了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112247\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4942/d5cf/38593_normal.png?m=1789935474\" alt=\"chemzqm\" data-uid=\"38593\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chemzqm\">chemzqm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 23:17:02 +08:00\">13h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在的 Astra 根本不适合写代码，不降智基本也没法用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112266\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 23:36:18 +08:00\">12h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也是受不了 gpt 降智，改投 claude 的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112784\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc46/0936/327769_normal.png?m=1696487536\" alt=\"edinina\" data-uid=\"327769\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/me